  (96260, '58fbe544-5413-4a90-84c3-c37abe118040'::uuid, 'CERAMIDE 1', 'Ceramide 1', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Ceramide 1 (Retired) is the N-acylated phytosphingosine having the erythro structure that conforms generally to the formula, where n has a value ranging from 10 to 20.

