  (96262, 'f9cde447-1ff8-4afd-abc5-b59c9bf04cb5'::uuid, 'CERAMIDE 2', 'Ceramide 2', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Ceramide 2 (Retired) is the N-acylated sphingolipid having the erythro structure that conforms generally to the formula, where m has a value ranging from 14 to 28 and n has a value ranging from 10 to 16.

