  (96263, '50802490-9f98-4c02-863e-5267228eb70a'::uuid, 'CERAMIDE 3', 'Ceramide 3', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Ceramide 3 (Retired) is the N-acylated phytosphingosine having the erythro structure that conforms generally to the formula, where m has a value ranging from 12 to 28 in which the acyl moiety may be saturated, mono-unsaturated, or di-unsaturated and n has a value ranging from 10 to 20.

