  (96270, 'af470610-4d97-4d60-bb5a-925907b23ddc'::uuid, 'MYRISTOYL GLYCINE/HISTIDINE/LYSINE POLYPEPTIDE', 'MYRISTOYL GLYCINE/HISTIDINE/LYSINE POLYPEPTIDE', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Myristoyl Glycine/Histidine/Lysine Polypeptide (Retired) is the product obtained by the reaction of myristic acid with a tripeptide consisting of gly-his-lys.

