Setaria Italica/Soybean/Sweet Almond/Wheat Seed)/Hordeum Vulgare Sprout/Cyperus Esculentus Tuber/Artemisia Princeps/Broccoli/Chenopodium Quinoa/Enteromorpha Compressa/Hordeum Vulgare/Ipomoea Batatas/Laminaria Japonica/Lentinus Edodes/Pleurotus Ostreatus/Porphyra Tenera/Undaria Pinnatifida Extract', NULL, 'This is the extract of the fruits of Citrus junos , Cucurbita pepo, Fragaria ananassa, Lens esculenta, Pyrus malus, Pyrus pyrifolia, and Solanum lycopersicum; the kernels of Zea mays; the leaves of Arctium lappa , Brassica oleracea acephala , Brassica oleracea capitata, Camellia sinensis , Moringa oleifera , Raphanus sativus, and Spinacia oleracea; the leaves and stems of Sorghum bicolor ; the meal of Avena sativa; the pulp of Solanum tuberosum; the roots of Daucus carota, Dioscorea oppositifolia, Nelumbo nucifera , and Raphanus sativus; the seeds of Amaranthus hypochondriacus , Anacardium occidentale, Cicer arietinum , Coix lacryma-Jobi ma-yuen  , Glycine max, Macadamia ternifolia , Oryza sativa, Phaseolus angularis , Pistacia vera , Prunus amygdalus dulcis, Rhynchosia nulubilis , Sesamum indicum, Setaria italica , and Triticum turgidum; the sprouts of Hordeum vulgare ; the tubers of Cyperus esculentus ; the whole plants, Artemisia princeps , Brassica oleracea italica, Chenopodium quinoa , Enteromorpha compressa , Hordeum vulgare , Ipomoea batatas , Laminaria japonica , Lentinus edodes , Pleurotus ostreatus , Porphyra tenera , and Undaria pinnatifida.', NULL, NULL, NULL, '[]', NULL, NULL, 'Active', FALSE, TRUE, NULL, 'GROWTH_COSING', 'Growth Cosmetic Ingredients and Substances', '{"apiVersion":"2.151","reference":"08f2bd3d-85e9-4c0e-b4f3-741f6084e0e5","url":"urn:test","contentType":"text/plain","language":"en","databaseLabel":"Growth Cosmetic Ingredients and Substances","database":"GROWTH_COSING","summary":"","weight":3.9449465,"content":"","accessRestriction":false,"checksum":"E3B0C44298FC1C149AFBF4C8996FB92427AE41E4649B934CA495991B7852B855","metadata":{"nameOfCo